on Silvia Maggioni sono ritratti: Luigi Ruffini, Lino}{\fs18\expnd1\expndtw8\cf1\cgrid  }{\fs18\expnd0\expndtw3\cf1\cgrid Calvo, Francesco }{\fs18\expnd1\expndtw8\cf1\cgrid D}{\fs18\expnd1\expndtw8\super\cf1\cgrid '}{\fs18\expnd0\expndtw3\cf1\cgrid Onofri
